          <div>Mindful living <br><span class="for">for</span><br> body & mind wellness</div>
          <div class="landingpagetext">Arogyam (noun): <strong>Health</strong>. Derived from "<i>aroga</i>" which means absence of disease. "<i>roga</i>": 
              derived from the Sanskrit root "<i>ruk</i>" or pain.
